==Description==
The '''Packed Ice''' was an enemy that first appeared in the second phase of [[Krampus Frosthold]] as part of the [[Krampus' Revenge Event]]. It had a high amount of health and a high amount of defense, reducing the damage from most sources by 50%, though it moved somewhat slowly. It was also immune to being frozen, slowed down and having its defense dropped by freezing towers.

It could be spawned by the [[Krampus (Krampus Frosthold)|Krampus]] from its ''Secret Santa'' ability.

==Appearance==
The '''Packed Ice''' was a humanoid made entirely out of ice. It had a light blue head and arms, with a darker blue translucent torso, waist and legs. Its right arm was bigger than its left arm, the former of which had a chunk gouged out of it. There was an entire chunk of ice missing in the middle of its torso, which held a heart-shaped piece of ice, connected to the torso by four rods.

==Strategy==
*High DPS towers, like the [[Minigunner]], [[Engineer]] or [[Ranger]] should be used to deal with this.
*The '''Packed Ice''' spawns in groups. Because of this, area of effect towers like the [[Mortar]], [[Pursuit]] and [[Pyromancer]] can be very useful here.
**As most splash towers ignore defense, they can be especially useful against this.
*As the '''Packed Ice's''' defense is quite high, defense dropping towers like the [[Pyromancer]] and [[Toxic Gunner]] can be useful at decreasing its defense.
**Do note that as this cannot be frozen, the [[Frost Blaster]] and [[Freezer]] cannot be used to decrease its defense.
**Multiple defense dropping towers, such as the [[Jester]] or [[Electroshocker]], can also be used to slow it down.

